      "standardized_narrative": "Syndicate 1200 opened 2019 with gross claims outstanding of GBP 767.4m. During 2019 the syndicate experienced an overall adverse development on prior years, reflected as a GBP 36.3m deterioration (strengthening of reserves), driven principally by large catastrophe losses from 2017 and prior (notably US hurricanes, California wildfires and Mexico earthquakes), and by attritional adverse development on certain short-tail classes. The movement was concentrated on property-exposed lines and several Marine/Energy subclasses that the syndicate has since exited. The development reflects both large loss activity and reserve recalibration and material adjustments were made to loss picks and reserving prudence.",
